{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"746965729420509185","content":"<@!366565198284324868> \n**Heavier Crossbow**\nHeavy, Loading, Range, Two-handed\nRequires at least 16 Strength\n\nThis heavy crossbow has been modified to fire javelins. It has an extra set of limbs to help fire the javelins and the stock rests on the wielder’s shoulder. The Heavier Crossbow deals 2d10+1d6 piercing damage. Before taking the attack action with the Heavier Crossbow you must aim at the target using your bonus action. You can only aim at one target per turn. Requires javelins to be used as ammo.","created_at":"2021-05-28T18:01:12.445000Z","edited_at":"2021-05-28T20:29:28.181000Z","id":"847897312395001876","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
