{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"746965729420509185","content":"Is this agreeable to all? Especially @ surlyArtificer.\n\n**\"The Shattered Dignity\" Antler Shard Shiv**\nmelee weapon (magical, dagger)\n**Category:** Items\n**Damage: **1d4\n**Damage Type:** Piercing/Slashing (called on attack)\n**Item Rarity:** Unique Homebrew (Mod TAO)\n**Properties: **Finesse, Light, Range, Thrown\n**Range: **20/60\n**Weight:** 1\nThis shard of Jackalope's Antler can be used like most knives, sharp fractures and jagged serrations cut readily through most living things. This item can easily be used to attack in three distinct ways: *Stabbing* (Piercing,) *Slicing* (Slashing) and *Thrown* (Piercing.) After being thrown, the Antler Shard Shiv must be retrieved manually.","created_at":"2021-06-20T01:29:19.722000Z","edited_at":"2021-06-20T01:30:12.947000Z","id":"855982618852196375","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
